ared at nearly"},{"start":267.8,"duration":5.76,"text":"5,000 logs."},{"start":270.36,"duration":4.8,"text":"Just a small part of our massive data"},{"start":273.56,"duration":3.84,"text":"set."},{"start":275.16,"duration":3.72,"text":"Still, that was a"},{"start":277.4,"duration":4.12,"text":"bit"},{"start":278.88,"duration":6.04,"text":"much, don't you think?"},{"start":281.52,"duration":6.52,"text":"But, thankfully, we found"},{"start":284.92,"duration":6.92,"text":"what we were looking for before"},{"start":288.04,"duration":6.64,"text":"finishing the full 5,000."},{"start":291.84,"duration":5.6,"text":"Here are two those"},{"start":294.68,"duration":2.76,"text":"cases."},{"start":297.52,"duration":5.64,"text":"Here is the first case."},{"start":299.68,"duration":5.04,"text":"We found highly suspicious text and"},{"start":303.16,"duration":5.32,"text":"image file"},{"start":304.72,"duration":6.08,"text":"in the impostor logs."},{"start":308.48,"duration":4.76,"text":"With titles such as building a"},{"start":310.8,"duration":5.4,"text":"relationship, clinic billing, first"},{"start":313.24,"duration":5.52,"text":"walk, sexual love making, and trust me"},{"start":316.2,"duration":2.56,"text":"fully."},{"start":319.04,"duration":8.96,"text":"In one text file, we found a script"},{"start":322.28,"duration":5.72,"text":"designed to gain a victim's trust."},{"start":328.52,"duration":6.36,"text":"We also discovered"},{"start":331.12,"duration":5.28,"text":"signed document, photos of a woman, and"},{"start":334.88,"duration":4.48,"text":"forged"},{"start":336.4,"duration":2.96,"text":"flight ticket."},{"start":340.32,"duration":5.36,"text":"Next is a screenshot of the desktop"},{"start":344.2,"duration":3.44,"text":"background"},{"start":345.68,"duration":4.36,"text":"of a suspect"},{"start":347.64,"duration":4.52,"text":"suspected illegal gambling site"},{"start":350.04,"duration":4.76,"text":"developer."},{"start":352.16,"duration":6.12,"text":"Of course, gambling i