urce,"},{"start":463.12,"duration":7.32,"text":"meaning information available to anyone."},{"start":467.04,"duration":7.68,"text":"And we did not engage in any"},{"start":470.44,"duration":4.28,"text":"transactions with criminals."},{"start":476.08,"duration":8.6,"text":"There was recently a major news story in"},{"start":479.96,"duration":4.72,"text":"Korea regarding job fishing."},{"start":484.96,"duration":5.92,"text":"It involved"},{"start":486.8,"duration":8.4,"text":"luring people with offer of high-paying"},{"start":490.88,"duration":6.72,"text":"job only to kidnap and imprison them,"},{"start":495.2,"duration":5.4,"text":"forcing them to join criminal"},{"start":497.6,"duration":3.0,"text":"organizations."},{"start":501.0,"duration":6.52,"text":"These incidents mainly occurred in"},{"start":503.92,"duration":3.6,"text":"Southeast Asia."},{"start":507.68,"duration":5.08,"text":"The victims"},{"start":509.24,"duration":7.48,"text":"were forced to work in romance scam,"},{"start":512.76,"duration":8.56,"text":"gambling, and voice fishing."},{"start":516.72,"duration":8.56,"text":"Therefore, we focused on Southeast Asia,"},{"start":521.32,"duration":6.72,"text":"assuming a high concentration"},{"start":525.28,"duration":6.68,"text":"of these criminals."},{"start":528.04,"duration":8.44,"text":"So, out of our vast"},{"start":531.96,"duration":7.04,"text":"amount of data, we decided focus"},{"start":536.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"focus"},{"start":539.0,"duration":7.12,"text":"specifically"},{"start":540.64,"duration":5.48,"text":"on the data from Southeast Asia."},{"start":550.4,"duration":7.8,"text":"The system structure is as follows."},{"start":554.4,"duration":9.12,"text":"Our parsed the low impostor logs into"},{"start":558.2,"duration":8.0,"text":"JSON and stored them in a database,"},{"start":563.52,"duration":7.0,"text":"processing the data to make it"},{"start":566.2,"duration":4.32,"text":"searchable via simple query."},{"start":572.52,"duration":7.68,"text":"Let me walk you through"},{"start":574.8,"duration":9.68,"text":"what the low data actually looks like."},{"start":580.2,"duration":9.12,"text":"First, we have auto fill and cookies,"},{"start":584.48,"duration":8.96,"text":"which track user activity."},{"start":589.32,"duration":6.68,"text":"We can also see installed software and"},{"start":593.44,"duration":5.08,"text":"system info, including a running"},{"start":596.0,"duration":5.96,"text":"process."},{"start":598.52,"duration":6.68,"text":"Now, regarding password,"},{"start":601.96,"duration":7.68,"text":"while the logs do contain them,"},{"start":605.2,"duration":7.4,"text":"we decided to mask them entirely to"},{"start":609.64,"duration":7.48,"text":"protect user privacy."},{"start":612.6,"duration":8.28,"text":"However, to identify if the same or"},{"start":617.12,"duration":5.72,"text":"similar accounts were used across"},{"start":620.88,"duration":4.96,"text":"different sites,"},{"start":622.84,"duration":4.84,"text":"we utilized the"},{"start":625.84,"duration":5.44,"text":"locality-sensitive"},{"start":627.68,"duration":6.56,"text":"hashing algorithm instead of"},{"start":631.28,"duration":2.96,"text":"plain text."},{"start":634.32,"duration":8.36,"text":"Finally, to search through all these"},{"start":637.52,"duration":8.04,"text":"data quickly, we needed to normalize it"},{"start":642.68,"duration":4.04,"text":"into JSON file."},{"start":645.56,"duration":6.8,"text":"But,"},{"start":646.72,"duration":5.64,"text":"this is where we faced some challenges."},{"start":653.6,"duration":9.0,"text":"To parse the data efficiently, we need"},{"start":657.68,"duration":4.92,"text":"these two build a parser."},{"start":662.76,"duration":7.2,"text":"Assuming that logs from the"},{"start":666.68,"duration":5.48,"text":"same Imposter family would share a"},{"start":669.96,"duration":5.92,"text":"similar data format,"},{"start":672.16,"duration":6.36,"text":"we decided to classify the stealer"},{"start":675.88,"