."},{"start":877.4,"duration":5.16,"text":"Ultimately, the system is there aid our"},{"start":880.4,"duration":5.44,"text":"judgment."},{"start":882.56,"duration":7.12,"text":"We review and verify the data to confirm"},{"start":885.84,"duration":6.68,"text":"whether the result points the legitimacy"},{"start":889.68,"duration":2.84,"text":"suspect."},{"start":892.76,"duration":5.2,"text":"Let's see the tool in action to"},{"start":895.24,"duration":5.44,"text":"understand its workflow and verify"},{"start":897.96,"duration":6.0,"text":"efficiency gains over conventional"},{"start":900.68,"duration":3.28,"text":"analysis techniques."},{"start":908.8,"duration":6.6,"text":"Simply put, this query looks for five or"},{"start":912.24,"duration":6.04,"text":"more auto login dating service account"},{"start":915.4,"duration":2.88,"text":"in the service."},{"start":945.56,"duration":9.48,"text":">> It is the impostor on screen and show"},{"start":950.36,"duration":4.68,"text":"reports of impostor overs."},{"start":957.52,"duration":6.16,"text":"And the password filters puf.com is"},{"start":960.76,"duration":2.92,"text":"dating service."},{"start":965.48,"duration":5.88,"text":"And"},{"start":967.56,"duration":7.88,"text":"it is find or 125"},{"start":971.36,"duration":4.08,"text":"account in single computer."},{"start":980.76,"duration":5.92,"text":"With a traditional method analogy"},{"start":983.56,"duration":4.28,"text":"analyzing this hypothesis to seven full"},{"start":986.68,"duration":4.0,"text":"days."},{"start":987.84,"duration":7.6,"text":"However, with our tool we identified"},{"start":990.68,"duration":7.32,"text":"exact same suspect in just five minutes."},{"start":995.44,"duration":5.76,"text":"This is massive time reduction in the"},{"start":998.0,"duration":5.16,"text":"cycle of hypothesizing, detecting and"},{"start":1001.2,"duration":4.48,"text":"verifying."},{"start":1003.16,"duration":3.8,"text":"It means we are no longer limited by"},{"start":1005.68,"